#X text 82 716 print: voice \, controls and sample rate to the Pd window, f 64;
#X text 82 732 choke \, chokems <ms>: fade the voice out \, default 3 ms, f 64;
#X text 82 748 store <0-15> \, recall <0-15>: 16 internal slots, f 64;
